flowchart TD
  U[User/API]
  SC[Create scan and targets]
  W[Worker run_scan]
  D1[Nmap discovery open ports to ports]
  D2[Nmap service detection update service name product version extra info]
  SP[service profile nuclei profiles yaml]
  TGT[Build nuclei target url or host port scan mode aware]
  TAGS[Select tags timeout rate validate tags apply exclusions]
  NR[Run nuclei per port]
  CMD[Nuclei flags target severity jsonl export silent no color no interactsh rate limit profile or default optional tags templates exclude templates]
  OUT[Nuclei JSONL output]
  P1[Parse nuclei output]
  TE[ToolExecution linked to ScanTarget and Port]
  VULN[Vulnerabilities including low and info severities]
  DB[Database]
  API[Backend API]
  FE[Frontend shows ports and vulnerabilities]

  U --> SC
  SC --> W
  W --> D1
  D1 --> D2
  D2 --> SP
  SP --> TGT
  SP --> TAGS
  TGT --> NR
  TAGS --> NR
  NR --> CMD
  NR --> OUT
  OUT --> P1
  P1 --> TE
  P1 --> VULN
  VULN --> DB
  DB --> API
  API --> FE
  FE --> U